Day Count is an application for planning and tracking the exact time before and after your events.

All you need to do is enter the date and description of the event, and Day Count will remind you of it, show how many days are left before, how many have passed after. It can be: Vacation, Wedding of a friend, Anniversary, Birthday (repeat every year), quit smoking, Demobilization, Length of service in the company and others. Set up a reminder every day, week, month, year - as you like.

Brief instruction:
1. Name your event;
2. Specify its date and time;
3. Customize the notification mode if desired;
4. Customize the appearance of the event card.

Download the application, set up events, and Day Count will remind and inform you!

